{"logId": "21ac7c7e-9d59-42fd-b8f9-c7cb7b152d81", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（孩子）", "block_bbox": [370, 119, 944, 168], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[370.0, 119.0], [944.0, 119.0], [944.0, 168.0], [370.0, 168.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）教育孩子以喜欢的状态做人做事，不为了追求名利、荣耀、面子等", "block_bbox": [401, 227, 1236, 267], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[401.0, 227.0], [1236.0, 227.0], [1236.0, 267.0], [401.0, 267.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）教育孩子不追求学历和竞争，不功利地学习，受教育和积累知识是为了辅助人生", "block_bbox": [402, 272, 1391, 312], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[402.0, 272.0], [1391.0, 272.0], [1391.0, 312.0], [402.0, 312.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）教育孩子怎么面对生活和生命，怎样个性、自由、勇敢地活自己，鼓励他们去过自己热爱的生活", "block_bbox": [402, 317, 1574, 357], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[402.0, 317.0], [1574.0, 317.0], [1574.0, 357.0], [402.0, 357.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（4）鼓励他们主宰自己的人生，轻松、乐观地规划人生", "block_bbox": [402, 363, 1053, 402], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[402.0, 363.0], [1053.0, 363.0], [1053.0, 402.0], [402.0, 402.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、重视对孩子的创新教育，培养孩子的创新思维和创新能力", "block_bbox": [386, 408, 1103, 447], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[386.0, 408.0], [1103.0, 408.0], [1103.0, 447.0], [386.0, 447.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）发掘孩子潜力和兴趣爱好，帮助孩子培养特长", "block_bbox": [402, 453, 999, 492], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[402.0, 453.0], [999.0, 453.0], [999.0, 492.0], [402.0, 492.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）鼓励和培养孩子的创造能力，不墨守成规", "block_bbox": [401, 498, 947, 537], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[401.0, 498.0], [947.0, 498.0], [947.0, 537.0], [401.0, 537.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、对孩子进行必要的性教育，包括性启蒙教育和生理安全教育", "block_bbox": [387, 543, 1128, 582], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[387.0, 543.0], [1128.0, 543.0], [1128.0, 582.0], [387.0, 582.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）营造轻松谈论性的家庭氛围，切忌回避孩子的性问题或严肃谈论", "block_bbox": [400, 588, 1207, 627], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[400.0, 588.0], [1207.0, 588.0], [1207.0, 627.0], [400.0, 627.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）借助书籍及视频对7岁以上的少年儿童传授妊娠和生育知识", "block_bbox": [402, 633, 1146, 672], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[402.0, 633.0], [1146.0, 633.0], [1146.0, 672.0], [402.0, 672.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）借助书籍及视频对青少年讲授生理与身体机能知识", "block_bbox": [402, 678, 1053, 717], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[402.0, 678.0], [1053.0, 678.0], [1053.0, 717.0], [402.0, 717.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（4）提醒恋爱期的子女注意性爱安全及避孕", "block_bbox": [401, 723, 923, 761], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[401.0, 723.0], [923.0, 723.0], [923.0, 761.0], [401.0, 761.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、发自内心地尊重子女，不干涉他们自主规划和选择人生状态", "block_bbox": [387, 768, 1131, 808], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[387.0, 768.0], [1131.0, 768.0], [1131.0, 808.0], [387.0, 808.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）尊重孩子的能力，不苛求、也不溺爱孩子", "block_bbox": [402, 813, 947, 852], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[402.0, 813.0], [947.0, 813.0], [947.0, 852.0], [402.0, 852.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "(2) 尊重子女自由择业", "block_bbox": [403, 858, 685, 897], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[403.0, 858.0], [685.0, 858.0], [685.0, 897.0], [403.0, 897.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[69]", "block_bbox": [967, 969, 1020, 997], "block_id": 16, "block_order": null, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[967.0, 969.0], [1019.0, 969.0], [1019.0, 996.0], [967.0, 996.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.9058125019073486, "coordinate": [370, 119, 944, 168], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[370.0, 119.0], [944.0, 119.0], [944.0, 168.0], [370.0, 168.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8748673796653748, "coordinate": [401, 227, 1236, 267], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[401.0, 227.0], [1236.0, 227.0], [1236.0, 267.0], [401.0, 267.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8750671148300171, "coordinate": [402, 272, 1391, 312], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[402.0, 272.0], [1391.0, 272.0], [1391.0, 312.0], [402.0, 312.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8887705206871033, "coordinate": [402, 317, 1574, 357], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[402.0, 317.0], [1574.0, 317.0], [1574.0, 357.0], [402.0, 357.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.864427387714386, "coordinate": [402, 363, 1053, 402], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[402.0, 363.0], [1053.0, 363.0], [1053.0, 402.0], [402.0, 402.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8868173956871033, "coordinate": [386, 408, 1103, 447], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[386.0, 408.0], [1103.0, 408.0], [1103.0, 447.0]